{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "Engine event v1",
  "description": "One event the engine writes to engine-events.jsonl. Closed: no extra key, no free text, no computed figure. Keys named text, message, content, output, prompt, description, title, body, branch, path, usd, cost, cost_usd, price or total_* never appear. Limits not expressible here (a plan_snapshot over 64 KiB, and a batch of 0 or over 100 events or one not strictly increasing in seq, or one whose events name an engine_instance_id other than the session's) are enforced by the cloud's own schema.",
